{"id":"fact-cli-001","type":"architecture","fact":"clawd-agents CLI (@solanaclawd/clawd-agents-cli) lives at agents/cli/ and is a Node.js ESM package with bin: clawd-agents. Commands: setup, scaffold (create/enhance/upgrade), deploy (vercel/vertex-ai/fly/railway), eval, publish, registry (list/connect/status/register), long, short, spot, ape, perps, goals (create/list/status/complete). 7 skills installed to ~/.agents/skills/clawd-agents-cli-*.","recommendation":"Use clawd-agents for all Solana agent project scaffolding, validation, and deployment. Starter template is clawd-perps-agent.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"CLI build 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["cli","agents","scaffold","caap","trading"],"affectedFiles":["agents/cli/src/cli.ts","agents/cli/package.json"],"affectedServices":["x402.wtf"],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-cli-002","type":"integration","fact":"agents/cli/src/auth/ bundles capabilities.ts, client.ts, index.ts from agents/auth/ as a package subpath export (./auth). Import: import { createClawdAgentClient } from '@solanaclawd/clawd-agents-cli/auth'. Uses @auth/agent ^0.5.1 and CAAP/1.0. registry-data.ts re-exports CLAWD_AUTH_BASE and CLAWD_DISCOVERY_URL from this module.","recommendation":"Always import CAAP constants from agents/auth/ or @solanaclawd/clawd-agents-cli/auth. Do not duplicate constants.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"CLI auth integration 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["caap","auth","client","constants"],"affectedFiles":["agents/cli/src/auth/","agents/auth/"],"affectedServices":["x402.wtf/api/auth"],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-cli-003","type":"integration","fact":"9 x402.wtf endpoints registered in Google Agent Registry (project x402-477302, global): /api/orchestrator, /api/agents, /api/clawd, /api/imperial, /api/perps/v1, /api/phoenix/markets, /api/router/v1/chat/completions, /api/x402/agent/chat, /agents/registry. Vertex AI Reasoning Engine ID 9023111387018166272 at us-west1.","recommendation":"Use 'clawd-agents registry list' to enumerate all endpoints and 'clawd-agents deploy --target vertex-ai' for RE deployment.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"Agent Registry 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["agent-registry","gcp","vertex-ai","endpoints"],"affectedFiles":["agents/cli/src/registry-data.ts"],"affectedServices":["x402.wtf","vertex-ai"],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-cli-004","type":"architecture","fact":"Trading commands (long/short/spot/ape) delegate to clawd-perps-agent/dist/cli.js when its workspace deps are installed. When unavailable, they fall back to an inline JSON order-shape preview with endpoint https://x402.wtf/api/perps/v1. Paper mode is always the default; --live flag + LIVE_TRADING=true + OPERATOR_CONFIRMED=true required for live.","recommendation":"Always paper-test before going live. Use --goal on any trading command to auto-create a tracked goal in goals/.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"Trading commands 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["trading","perps","safety","paper-mode"],"affectedFiles":["agents/cli/src/commands/trading.ts"],"affectedServices":["x402.wtf/api/perps/v1","x402.wtf/api/imperial"],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-cli-005","type":"integration","fact":"Goals stored as JSON in solana-clawd/goals/ (repo) or ~/.openclawd/goals/ (user), mirroring dist/agent/goals.d.ts and goals/generator/src/types.ts. TradingGoal shape: id, active, priority, title, body, skill (perps|spot), symbol, side, notionalUsd, leverage, targetPrice, createdAt. Create via CLI or --goal flag on trading commands.","recommendation":"Use goals to track and audit trading intent. Load active goals with loadActiveGoals() from dist/agent/goals.js for the leviathan loop.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"Goals integration 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["goals","trading","automation","leviathan"],"affectedFiles":["agents/cli/src/commands/goals.ts","goals/","dist/agent/goals.js"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-cli-006","type":"integration","fact":"ClawdRouter free LLM access for all Clawd agents: (1) clawdrouter/src/proxy/server.ts adds GET /v1/agent-key endpoint that mints clawd_free_<nonce> keys with FREE tier access (20 req/hr, budget models, eco profile). (2) authenticateChatRequest in platform mode bypasses x402.wtf validation for clawd_free_* keys — server's shared OPENROUTER_API_KEY proxies all calls. (3) clawd-agents setup calls /health + /v1/agent-key, writes OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://clawdrouter.fly.dev/v1 and OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<key> to ~/.openclawd/.env. (4) scaffold create auto-injects these vars into new project .env. (5) clawd-pump ($CLAWD token 8cHzQHUS2s2h8TzCmfqPKYiM4dSt4roa3n7MyRLApump) gates higher tiers: HOLDER(1K+)=100/hr, DIAMOND(100K+)=500/hr no-x402, WHALE(1M+)=unlimited no-x402.","recommendation":"Run 'clawd-agents setup' to auto-provision free LLM routing. Use 'clawd-agents pump [wallet]' to check $CLAWD tier. Buy $CLAWD at pump.fun/coin/8cHzQHUS2s2h8TzCmfqPKYiM4dSt4roa3n7MyRLApump to unlock higher tiers.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"ClawdRouter free-key integration 2026-06-05","date":"2026-06-05"}],"tags":["clawdrouter","openrouter","free-tier","clawd-pump","llm","setup"],"affectedFiles":["clawdrouter/src/proxy/server.ts","agents/cli/src/commands/setup.ts","agents/cli/src/commands/scaffold.ts","agents/cli/src/commands/pump.ts"],"affectedServices":["clawdrouter.fly.dev","openrouter.ai","pump.fun"],"createdAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
